## 6-PHASE WORKFLOW

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> P0: Start
    P0 --> P1: Inventory complete
    P1 --> P2: Flows documented
    P2 --> P3: Mappings documented
    P3 --> P4: Profiles & Functions documented
    P4 --> P5: Connectors documented
    P5 --> [*]: Zero data loss certified
```

| Phase | Name | Scope | Deliverable |
|-------|------|-------|-------------|
| **0** | Discovery & Planning | Scan ALL XMLs, classify, count elements, build reading plan | Sections 1-2, component-inventory.md |
| **1** | Flow Documentation | Per-process RGV: shapes, diagrams, step-by-step | Section 3, shape-configuration.md |
| **2** | Mapping Documentation | Per-map RGV: field mappings (ALL rows) with grouped reads | Section 4 (Field Mappings in main doc) |
| **3** | Profile & Function Docs | Per-profile/function RGV: ALL fields, ALL steps/scripts | function-reference.md, profile-structures.md |
| **4** | Connector & Cross-Ref Docs | Per-connector/operation/crossref RGV: ALL settings/data | Section 5, connector-settings.md |
| **5** | Validation & Certification | File-by-file reconciliation, gap analysis, certification | Sections 6-7, verification-checklist.md |

**Processing:** Continuous with micro-checkpoints per section (no user stops between phases)

