## OUTPUT STRUCTURE

```
project/output_boomi/{flow_number}/
├── boomi_design_{flow_name}.md          # Main document (7 sections)
├── supporting-docs/
│   ├── component-inventory.md           # Phase 0: All components with counts
│   ├── shape-configuration.md           # Phase 1: ALL shape configs
│   ├── function-reference.md            # Phase 3: Functions with complete details
│   ├── profile-structures.md            # Phase 3: ALL fields (mapped AND unmapped)
│   ├── connector-settings.md            # Phase 4: Full operational details
│   └── verification-checklist.md        # Phase 5: Counts, reconciliation, certification
└── .boomi-state.json                    # State for resume (6 phases)
```

**Naming:** `{flow_number}` from process name (e.g., `HNK_US_PRC_13020_...` → `13020`).
**Formats:** See `lib/docs/template-configuration.md` for exact supporting doc formats.

